<title>POLAND: PPABANK APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>PPABANK APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.14 vs   0.38</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.91 vs   0.86</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  5.33 vs   2.90</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 6.28 vs   3.96</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  4.16 vs   1.74</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    6.72 vs   3.26</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 17.61 vs  11.46</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	23.29 vs  15.58</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Pierwszy Polsko-</p>
<p>Amerykanski Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
